<title>ISRAEL: ESC says FDA approves its medical laser.</title>
<headline>ESC says FDA approves its medical laser.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESC Medical Systems Ltd said on Tuesday it had received clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) to market its Derma 20 laser system in the United States.</p>
<p>The Derma 20 is used for general dermatological applications, including skin resurfacing. ESC said 50 of the laser systems have been sold outside the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;FDA approval of the Derma 20 provides a significant new opportunity for ECS within the United States,&quot; ESC president and chief executive officer Shimon Eckhouse said in a statement.</p>
</text>
